# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary's hunts

step Panthers, raptors and elder tigers
  tip Back south past Nesingwary: Panthers and Stranglethorn Raptors run in the clearings west of the camp toward the coast; the elder tigers hold the hills south-west.
  kill 736 quest 191                  -- Panther
  accept 635 optional                 -- Gluggle (37, rare) on the coast west of camp drops the Pendant of Myzrael: four levels over you, leave him unless you are grouped
  accept 97328 @31.5,12.8 map 1434    -- Thoroughly Scavenged Supplies, a looted crate west of Nesingwary's camp: the Stolen Shipments lie in the Bloodscalp ruins on the coast, for the second Stranglethorn loop

step Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  tip Back east to Nesingwary's camp on the way north to the Rebel Camp.
  turnin 191
  accept 192                          -- keep it: the Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) wait for the 40-50 Stranglethorn guide

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Rebel Camp

step Rebel Camp
  tip Take the road north; the camp sits in the hills to the west.
  tip Private Thorsen offers Jungle Secrets only while he is out of the camp: about every half hour he walks down the path to the road, where two Kurzen's Agents ambush him. Help him kill them and take the quest at once, before he walks back up. He isn't there? Leave it: the guide passes Bookie Herod, which follows from it, as well.
  tip Private Thorsen spends most of his time at the top of the Rebel Camp's path, by the huts, and now and then walks down it to the road and back (about eight minutes). If he isn't at the arrow, look along that path.
  accept 215 @40.3,8.4 optional       -- Private Thorsen, at the foot of the path
  turnin 198 @38.0,3.4                -- Private Thorsen: at the top of the path by the huts, or on his walk down it
  turnin 215                          -- Lieutenant Doren, in the hut
  accept 200                          -- Lieutenant Doren: Bookie Herod's records lie at the edge of Kurzen's Compound, next
  accept 210                          -- Corporal Kaleb: for Krazek in Booty Bay, later in this guide
  accept 203                          -- Sergeant Yohwa
  accept 204

step Kurzen's Compound: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The Kurzen rebels hold the camp east of the Rebel Camp; work its outer edge, where Jungle Fighters and Medicine Men stand, and loot the supply crates by the tents. Bookie Herod's records lie in a hut on the compound's west side. Careful: Kurzen Elites and Witch Doctors (36) hold the compound's eastern half, by the cave: stay on its west side.
  turnin 200                          -- Bookie Herod's Records, in the hut
  accept 328                          -- The strongbox is deeper in, by the cave: on the northern loop (04b)
  collect 2633 quest 204.1            -- Jungle Remedy
  kill 937 quest 203                  -- Kurzen Jungle Fighter
  collect 2634 quest 204.2            -- Venom Fern Extract, from a Kurzen Supplies crate

step Level 33.2
  when level<33.2
  tip The elder tigers next are 34-35: short of 33.2? Keep on the Kurzen Jungle Fighters and Medicine Men around the compound's outer edge until level 33.2. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Library) instead.
  goto 44.6,10.0 map 1434 "Kurzen Jungle Fighter"
  level 33.2 grind 937                 -- grind on Kurzen Jungle Fighter

step Rebel Camp
  turnin 203                          -- Sergeant Yohwa
  turnin 204

step Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Careful: Troll camps are close to the tiger area, and trolls can join a fight if you pull carelessly.
  tip Careful: The raptor nest has young raptors that join the fight when you attack the adults.
  kill 1085 quest 187                 -- Elder Stranglethorn Tiger
  kill 685 quest 194                  -- Stranglethorn Raptor

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  tip Barnil collects the Green Hills of Stranglethorn: the pages drop from almost every humanoid in the jungle. Turn the pages into chapters as you go.
  accept 339 optional
  accept 340 optional
  accept 341 optional
  accept 342 optional
  turnin 187                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 188                          -- Keep it for another visit: Sin'Dall (37) prowls the Lashtail hill.
  turnin 194                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  accept 195                          -- keep it: the Lashtail Raptors come on the second loop (04b), around Sin'Dall's hill

step The Savage Coast
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip From Nesingwary's camp head west to the Crystalvein Mine near the coast; the Crystal Spine Basilisks around it drop the shards.
  tip The haunted island lies just off the coast south-west of the mine: just reach its edge. Careful: its Lesser Water Elementals are 36-37: don't stay. The Bloodscalp ruins of Zul'Kunda to the north wait for the second Stranglethorn loop.
  collect 3918 quest 605 @24.2,17.7 map 1434 -- Singing Crystal Shard
  complete 578 @21.9,22.4             -- The haunted island

