  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 27.5,77.7 "Booty Bay flight master"
  fly "Stormwind"
  zone Stormwind City

step Grimand Elmore
  turnin 322

step Collin Mauren
  when complete 1078
  tip Collin Mauren is in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter.
  turnin 1078

step Class training
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Your level 34 ranks: the class trainers stand around the Trade District, Old Town, the Cathedral and the Mage Quarter; Sheldras Moontree, the druid trainer, stands north-west of the Mage Quarter. Shamans train in Ironforge, later in 30-40.
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid

step Boat to Auberdine
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 22.71,56.69 "Boat to Auberdine" live

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Desolace

step Fly to Stonetalon Peak
  when taxi "Stonetalon Peak"
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Druid
  zone Darkshore
  tip You know the Stonetalon Peak flight: it lands closer to Desolace than Astranaar does. From the peak, follow the road south through the mountains to the Charred Vale.
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Stonetalon Peak"
  zone Stonetalon Mountains

step Fly to Astranaar
  when !taxi "Stonetalon Peak"
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Astranaar"
  zone Ashenvale

step Fly to Astranaar
  when taxi "Stonetalon Peak"
  only Warlock
  zone Darkshore
  tip Warlocks fly to Astranaar for the Heartswood, on the way west.
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Astranaar"
  zone Ashenvale

step Heartswood
  only Warlock
  zone Ashenvale
  tip From Astranaar head north-west into the hills: the Heartswood is a glowing tree north of the road to Maestra's Post. If you took What Is Love?, the Wooden Figurine lies in a house among the trees north of Maestra's Post (26.6,22.0). Then take the road west to Stonetalon.
  collect 6912 quest 1738.1               -- Heartswood
  collect 190309 quest 65602.1 optional   -- Wooden Figurine, north of Maestra's Post

step Stonetalon Mountains
  when !zone "Desolace"
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  goto 30.0,76.5 "Stonetalon Mountains"

